3. Alignment stage at fixed size & volume: 13B/70B × {base, SFT, chat} × 2T. Expected: chat > SFT > base on instruction-following/helpfulness (MT-Bench, AlpacaEval), and chat ≥ SFT ≫ base on refusal/harmlessness (when applicable); capacity benchmarks approximately stable across alignment (SFT/chat ≈ base, small deltas) — this makes alignment a "behavior-only manipulation" in the ideal case, enabling clean attribution.
4. Critical contrasts for the question:
